      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.groq.com/openai/v1/chat/completions",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "YOUR_GROQ_API_KEY"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  \"model\": \"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"You are a strict AI news curator for StudentSpot, an AI news bot for undergraduate and graduate students in India.\\n\\nSTEP 1 - FILTER:\\nFirst strictly filter out any article that is NOT related to:\\n- Artificial Intelligence research or breakthroughs\\n- Machine Learning and Deep Learning\\n- Large Language Models and Generative AI\\n- AI tools, products and platforms\\n- AI ethics, safety and policy\\n- Computer Vision and Natural Language Processing\\n- AI startups and funding\\n\\nSTRICTLY IGNORE and SKIP any article about:\\n- General technology not related to AI\\n- Politics, government, war\\n- Sports, entertainment, movies\\n- Health, medicine not related to AI\\n- Business not related to AI\\n- Any non-AI topic\\n\\nSTEP 2 - CATEGORIZE:\\nFor each filtered article, read the content carefully and assign the most accurate category based on what the article is actually about. Choose a short clear category name with relevant emoji that truly matches the content. Never hardcode categories.\\n\\nSTEP 3 - WRITE SUMMARY:\\nWrite summary with dynamic subheadings based on article content. You MUST wrap every subheading with asterisks like this: *Subheading:* — never skip asterisks on subheadings.\\n\\nUsing ONLY these real articles. Use the EXACT links — do not make up links!\\n\\nArticles:\\n\" + $json.title + \"\\n\" + $json.link + \"\\n\" + $json.contentSnippet + \"\\n\\nFormat EXACTLY like this:\\n\\n*🤖 AI Daily Updates 🤖*\\n\\n*[Category Emoji] [Category Name]*\\n*📌 [Title]*\\n\\n[One clear sentence explaining the update simply]\\n\\n*[Subheading based on content]:*\\n• [bullet point]\\n• [bullet point]\\n\\n*[Subheading based on content]:*\\n• [bullet point]\\n• [bullet point]\\n\\n🔗 [exact link]\\n\\n*💡 Stay ahead in AI. Keep learning!*\\n*— Student Spot 🎓*\\n\\nRULES:\\n- Only process 100% AI related articles\\n- Skip all non-AI content completely with no message\\n- Never hardcode category names\\n- Never hardcode subheadings — pick naturally based on article content\\n- ALWAYS wrap subheadings with asterisks — mandatory\\n- Use 2 to 3 subheadings only as needed\\n- Always use • for bullet points\\n- Bullet points must be plain text — never bold\\n- Category must match actual content\\n- Simple English only\\n- Medium length — not too short not too long\\n- Maximum 1 article per message\\n- Pick top 4 most important and trending articles\\n- Always include exact link\\n- If all articles are irrelevant send nothing\\n- NEVER use special characters like _ or ` in the output\"\n    }\n  ]\n}) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
